{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And he said: If he comes, etc.</b> Meaning: if Esav comes to wage war and strikes the first camp, the second camp that he prepared for war will be for escape. When he begins and sees that he hates him, the escape camp that he prepared with weapons will certainly save him, and perhaps even the first camp will be spared from being entirely destroyed. And Jacob did everything with consideration, so that he would not need a miracle, and HaShem will complete on his behalf."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:45:31.957105441Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}